@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title US006 - Register a Publishing Company (Main)
box #WhiteSmoke
actor Administrator
participant ":UI006" as UI
end box
participant ":US006ToRegisterNewPublisherController" as Controller
participant ":PublisherFactory" as PublisherFactory
participant ":PublisherRepository" as PublisherRepository

Administrator -> UI : I want to register a Publishing Company
activate UI
UI --> Administrator : Please provide name, vatNumber and contact
deactivate UI

Administrator -> UI : Name: Cambridge; VatNumber: 123456; Contact: +4412345678
activate UI
UI -> Controller : registerPublisher(name, vatNumber, contact)
activate Controller

ref over Controller, PublisherFactory, PublisherRepository
    Register Publisher
    [see full detail diagram]
end ref

Controller --> UI : publisher
deactivate Controller
UI --> Administrator : success
deactivate UI
@enduml